<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on HCIA.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Alex. Brown on HCIA.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it downgraded HCIA Inc to neutral from strong buy after the company issued a profit warning, but later upgraded it back to strong buy after a sharp drop in the stock's price.</p>
<p>-- HCIA was off 28-1/4 to 31-3/4 in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available.</p>
</text>
